3562
03:32:00,770 --> 03:32:09,590
We are gonna go into a cave, an actual big cave, and see the radius at which they spawn, so I can gauge how far I need to be away.

3563
03:32:11,410 --> 03:32:12,770
That is actually great.

3564
03:32:13,830 --> 03:32:15,510
I need my... do I have the thing?

3565
03:32:15,590 --> 03:32:15,810
I do.

3566
03:32:16,230 --> 03:32:16,890
How many rockets?

3567
03:32:17,910 --> 03:32:18,230
Nine.

3568
03:32:18,470 --> 03:32:19,050
Okay, that's not bad.

3569
03:32:22,070 --> 03:32:23,050
My inventory sucks, though.

3570
03:32:23,130 --> 03:32:23,950
Let me fix that before I go.

3571
03:32:31,870 --> 03:32:32,190
In.

3572
03:32:33,170 --> 03:32:33,490
Dirt.

3573
03:32:35,290 --> 03:32:35,610
Cobblestone.

3574
03:32:38,550 --> 03:32:41,430
Now that I have a good bow, I don't need the crossbow anymore.

3575
03:32:46,880 --> 03:32:52,200
Fish and... money goes in here.

3576
03:32:56,380 --> 03:32:57,480
I'm gonna keep that as well.

3577
03:32:59,000 --> 03:33:02,460
I'm too fond of my fishing rod to bring that with me, I think.

3578
03:33:03,440 --> 03:33:04,460
