3579
03:33:06,360 --> 03:33:07,680
We don't need that while we're going.

3580
03:33:09,280 --> 03:33:11,280
Sticks and stones, mine jack.

3581
03:33:13,300 --> 03:33:14,460
The hoe, we don't need that either.

3582
03:33:16,080 --> 03:33:17,180
Unless, maybe we do.

3583
