If we find Skulk, right?

3584
03:33:22,630 --> 03:33:25,310
If we find Skulk... Wait, did I lose a bundle?

3585
03:33:31,550 --> 03:33:34,350
I think I may have deposited a bundle somewhere.

3586
03:33:37,010 --> 03:33:39,970
Unless I only had four... No, I had five, I'm pretty sure.

3587
03:33:46,910 --> 03:33:48,090
It's not in here.

3588
03:33:50,190 --> 03:33:51,030
Ah, whatever.

3589
03:33:52,290 --> 03:33:53,570
I probably only had four.

3590
03:33:55,130 --> 03:33:58,290
So I have sword, I have this, I have... I need more food.

3591
03:33:58,390 --> 03:33:59,250
More food, for sure.

3592
03:33:59,630 --> 03:34:00,410
And you know what?

3593
03:34:00,690 --> 03:34:02,510
It's been a while since I've gone caving.

3594
03:34:03,010 --> 03:34:04,250
This is actually wonderful.

3595
03:34:05,850 --> 03:34:07,870
That way we can test a couple things, you know?

3596
03:34:07,930 --> 03:34:08,410
It's gonna be great.

3597
03:34:10,550 --> 03:34:13,430
Yeah, I think 64 baked potatoes should be more than enough.

3598
03:34:14,410 --> 03:34:14,990
Hell yeah.

3599
03:34:16,880 --> 03:34:17,880
Suspicious stew.

3600
03:34:19,300 --> 03:34:20,480
We have the arrows.

3601
