3614
03:34:51,370 --> 03:34:52,110
I need to look at my book.

3615
03:34:53,550 --> 03:34:54,690
Book of...

3616
03:35:00,170 --> 03:35:00,570
Preparation.

3617
03:35:02,950 --> 03:35:03,350
Torches.

3618
03:35:03,610 --> 03:35:04,030
I have it.

3619
03:35:04,990 --> 03:35:05,390
Shield!

3620
03:35:05,510 --> 03:35:06,110
Oh my god!

3621
03:35:07,090 --> 03:35:08,150
A shield, of course.

3622
03:35:08,830 --> 03:35:09,810
How could I forget?

3623
03:35:14,350 --> 03:35:15,430
There we go, wow.

3624
03:35:16,770 --> 03:35:17,790
Good thing I have this, huh?

3625
03:35:18,150 --> 03:35:18,810
Arrows, done.

3626
03:35:18,970 --> 03:35:19,650
Flint and Tender, done.

3627
03:35:20,390 --> 03:35:21,550
Night vision potion, yo!

3628
03:35:21,910 --> 03:35:22,350
I need that.

3629
03:35:24,370 --> 03:35:25,550
And I believe I have it.

3630
03:35:30,450 --> 03:35:30,850
Huh?

3631
03:35:31,050 --> 03:35:33,490
Did they make a million of those down in the room?

3632
03:35:37,730 --> 03:35:39,110
I forgot the color of it.

3633
03:35:46,490 --> 03:35:47,550
Are you kidding me?

3634
03:35:49,710 --> 03:35:50,330
It's fine.

3635
03:35:50,530 --> 03:35:51,030
I don't need it.

3636
03:35:52,310 --> 03:35:52,830
It's okay.

3637
03:35:55,960 --> 03:35:57,460
No, no, that actually belongs there.

3638
03:35:58,540 --> 03:36:00,580
Then I also need wood.

3639
03:36:01,320 --> 03:36:02,100
I have it.

3640
03:36:03,000 --> 03:36:03,760
Spyglass, check.

3641
03:36:04,000 --> 03:36:04,940
Potion of fire resistance.

3642
03:36:07,580 --> 03:36:08,580
I'll take one of them.

3643
03:36:09,320 --> 03:36:10,760
It can hurt, right?

3644
03:36:10,940 --> 03:36:12,320
If I fall into some lava somehow.

3645
03:36:12,700 --> 03:36:13,020
Who knows?

3646
03:36:14,900 --> 03:36:18,940
And if I'm lucky, I'm actually going to find another trial chamber.

3647
03:36:19,100 --> 03:36:19,760
I would love that.

3648
03:36:20,600 --> 03:36:21,260
Oh, a bed.

3649
03:36:21,780 --> 03:36:23,120
Bring that for sure.

3650
03:36:24,480 --> 03:36:28,480
In fact, leave one in there and we are going to grab a bit from the ritual site.

3651
03:36:33,800 --> 03:36:34,400
Got it.

3652
03:36:35,540 --> 03:36:35,940
Nice.

3653
03:36:36,080 --> 03:36:36,500
And a boat.

3654
03:36:36,700 --> 03:36:37,200
And a boat.

3655
03:36:37,300 --> 03:36:37,520
And a boat.

3656
03:36:38,280 --> 03:36:39,080
Boat is essential.

3657
03:36:41,340 --> 03:36:42,060
There we go.

3658
03:36:42,280 --> 03:36:44,340
This should be... good.

3659
03:36:46,020 --> 03:36:49,040
I also brought a bucket, because we always need that, and a towel.

3660
03:36:50,940 --> 03:36:52,200
Now, where do I want to go?

3661
03:36:52,920 --> 03:36:54,100
Uh, sleep first.

3662
03:36:59,970 --> 03:37:01,170
Which cave is a good one?

3663
03:37:02,190 --> 03:37:03,650
I want to find a new cave, I think.

3664
03:37:03,910 --> 03:37:05,790
Let's combine this expedition here.

3665
03:37:06,530 --> 03:37:07,570
So we're going to go caving.

3666
03:37:07,830 --> 03:37:12,470
We're going to go test the spawn radius of mobs.

3667
03:37:13,970 --> 03:37:16,370
And we're going to find materials that we need, such as coal.

3668
03:37:16,990 --> 03:37:18,850
I am fresh out of coal.

3669
03:37:19,190 --> 03:37:19,930
You know, stuff like that.

3670
03:37:21,410 --> 03:37:23,790
So what I'm trying to do now, I want to find a big cave.

3671
03:37:23,970 --> 03:37:25,510
So usually they're inside big mountains.

3672
03:37:26,870 --> 03:37:27,590
Also, I...

3673
03:37:27,560 --> 03:37:28,320
Brought the bop.

3674
03:37:28,460 --> 03:37:28,660
Fuck.

3675
03:37:28,800 --> 03:37:29,480
Let me bring it back.

3676
03:37:29,600 --> 03:37:30,800
I don't want to lose that book, actually.

3677
03:37:31,620 --> 03:37:32,520
That's quite important.

3678
03:37:35,720 --> 03:37:39,240
We're gonna go to a mountain that I have never been to before.

3679
03:37:39,520 --> 03:37:41,220
We're gonna find out if there's a cave inside.

3680
03:37:43,540 --> 03:37:44,400
That's the plan.

3681
03:37:45,840 --> 03:37:47,480
And boy, is it a good plan.

3682
03:37:48,440 --> 03:37:49,260
There it is.

3683
03:37:50,820 --> 03:37:51,940
Oh, ascension blocks!

3684
03:37:53,200 --> 03:37:55,000
Give me, like, a stack of dirt.

3685
03:37:56,400 --> 03:37:59,560
Never know when you need some dirt... in your pocket.

3686
03:38:04,540 --> 03:38:05,520
Okay.

3687
03:38:09,700 --> 03:38:10,460
And off we go.

3688
03:38:10,560 --> 03:38:12,500
I'm setting off from the dock, of course.

3689
03:38:13,460 --> 03:38:16,380
I still want to make this little sort of boathouse down here.

3690
03:38:17,380 --> 03:38:18,380
Will we have a roof?

3691
03:38:19,120 --> 03:38:21,320
Maybe make the dock a little wider as well?

3692
03:38:22,940 --> 03:38:24,460
It's gonna be real nice looking.

3693
03:38:26,600 --> 03:38:29,140
So there's a big mountain over there, actually, and there.

3694
03:38:30,680 --> 03:38:31,860
Maybe there's something inside.

3695
03:38:32,560 --> 03:38:33,720
A big old cave, maybe?

3696
03:38:39,470 --> 03:38:41,790
I'm gonna go this one, I think.

3697
03:38:42,510 --> 03:38:45,090
Let's check out that mountain there.

3698
03:38:53,150 --> 03:38:54,630
I should look for an opening.

3699
03:38:56,170 --> 03:38:58,070
On the sides somewhere.

3700
03:39:05,890 --> 03:39:07,390
Or I could just go on top.

3701
03:39:13,340 --> 03:39:14,240
Oh, we got something?

3702
03:39:15,560 --> 03:39:16,960
Oh, here we go, here we go, here we go.

3703
03:39:17,780 --> 03:39:19,220
Ah, no, not really.

3704
03:39:21,440 --> 03:39:22,380
Not at all, actually.

3705
03:39:30,010 --> 03:39:31,630
It actually feels good to be away from home.

3706
03:39:31,770 --> 03:39:33,510
I've been at home way too long there.

3707
03:39:36,030 --> 03:39:38,950
I don't even remember the last time I left home.

3708
03:39:41,350 --> 03:39:45,110
It's good to be back out here, even though it's still just in my backyard.

3709
03:39:45,330 --> 03:39:46,750
I have a beacon up here.

3710
03:39:54,250 --> 03:39:55,190
Is there no cave?

3711
03:40:04,620 --> 03:40:06,020
I could also try this over there.

3712
03:40:06,120 --> 03:40:06,660
That looks interesting.

3713
03:40:09,540 --> 03:40:10,340
There's my beacon.

3714
03:40:11,820 --> 03:40:12,980
Burning really bright.

3715
03:40:18,500 --> 03:40:19,640
We're gonna try going down.

3716
03:40:21,520 --> 03:40:22,900
We're making a spiral staircase.

3717
03:40:24,140 --> 03:40:26,100
We're going into the mountain like the dwarves.

3718
03:40:31,430 --> 03:40:32,790
Why can I never figure this out?

3719
03:40:32,990 --> 03:40:33,810
Oh, yeah, like this.

3720
03:40:34,730 --> 03:40:36,230
Nice coal, that's what I needed.

3721
03:40:36,830 --> 03:40:37,230
Wonderful.

3722
03:40:39,270 --> 03:40:40,210
Oh, no!

3723
03:40:44,090 --> 03:40:45,370
I'm touching silk!

3724
03:40:48,390 --> 03:40:49,530
Fuck, dude.

3725
03:40:49,930 --> 03:40:50,490
You know what?

3726
03:40:50,650 --> 03:40:51,170
It's fine.

3727
03:40:52,050 --> 03:40:52,810
What the fuck ever.

3728
03:40:53,990 --> 03:40:54,950
I don't want to go back.

3729
03:40:55,250 --> 03:40:55,850
I'm sorry.

3730
03:40:56,390 --> 03:40:57,230
I'm not going back.

3731
03:40:57,370 --> 03:40:57,590
No, no.

3732
03:41:02,460 --> 03:41:03,160
It's fine.

3733
03:41:09,880 --> 03:41:10,500
And you know what?

3734
03:41:10,540 --> 03:41:12,100
I guess I'm getting a bunch of stone here as well.

3735
03:41:12,460 --> 03:41:14,200
Like actual stone, not cobblestone.

3736
03:41:14,780 --> 03:41:16,320
Which is kind of useful for building.

3737
03:41:18,040 --> 03:41:19,500
So it's not the end of the world.

3738
03:41:22,640 --> 03:41:27,680
Best part is I'm also repairing it every time I mine stuff like coal.

3739
03:41:32,170 --> 03:41:34,490
Also, I feel like I fucked up this spiral staircase.

3740
03:41:47,740 --> 03:41:48,860
Yeah, it's definitely not.

3741
03:41:48,960 --> 03:41:51,300
This is very warped, but it's okay.

3742
03:41:53,100 --> 03:41:55,180
I'm approximately going straight down, you know?

3743
03:41:55,240 --> 03:41:56,140
That's all that matters right now.

3744
03:41:57,320 --> 03:42:00,380
I just don't want to make a purely straight down dig.

3745
03:42:01,540 --> 03:42:02,440
You don't want that.

3746
03:42:03,180 --> 03:42:04,580
Bad things happen when you do that.

3747
03:42:15,880 --> 03:42:17,560
More lava?

3748
03:42:22,800 --> 03:42:23,640
Promising?

3749
03:42:31,280 --> 03:42:32,360
Right here.

3750
03:42:36,260 --> 03:42:37,700
Let's try and dig that way.

3751
03:42:48,790 --> 03:42:50,510
Oh, it's like a little lava deposit.

3752
03:42:50,750 --> 03:42:50,890
Okay.

3753
03:42:51,650 --> 03:42:52,630
Not very exciting.

3754
03:42:53,490 --> 03:42:53,890
Shit.

3755
03:43:01,950 --> 03:43:02,350
Ah.

3756
03:43:03,830 --> 03:43:04,510
Make it here.

3757
03:43:12,130 --> 03:43:14,790
I have to remember, I started quite far up, right?

3758
03:43:14,950 --> 03:43:16,830
So I'm not even close to being near the bottom.

3759
03:43:28,750 --> 03:43:29,670
Okay, fuck it.

3760
03:43:30,590 --> 03:43:31,650
I'm going... no, no, no.

3761
03:43:31,850 --> 03:43:32,770
Stick to the schedule.

3762
03:43:33,710 --> 03:43:34,850
We're still going down.

3763
03:43:35,350 --> 03:43:36,610
We're not veering off.

3764
03:43:42,330 --> 03:43:42,790
Oh!

3765
03:43:43,710 --> 03:43:44,430
It's music.

3766
03:43:48,090 --> 03:43:51,810
That... I feel like I haven't had much music today, so that just caught me off guard.

3767
03:43:55,230 --> 03:43:56,270
It came out of nowhere.

3768
03:43:59,580 --> 03:44:03,460
Things coming out of nowhere, that is the definition of... a jump scare.

3769
03:44:08,200 --> 03:44:09,340
Haven't found much coal.

3770
03:44:13,720 --> 03:44:14,680
Sorry, I had to sneeze.

3771
03:44:16,700 --> 03:44:17,300
I'm okay.

3772
03:44:20,740 --> 03:44:21,700
Nearly died, though.

3773
03:44:26,560 --> 03:44:29,540
You know that feeling when you sneeze and you also yell at the same time?

3774
03:44:29,700 --> 03:44:31,340
I've started doing that quite a lot.

3775
03:44:31,460 --> 03:44:31,920
I don't know why.

3776
03:44:32,380 --> 03:44:37,380
Like, whenever I sneeze, I'm... like, when the sneeze happens, I let out a... like, a loud as yell as I can.

3777
03:44:38,260 --> 03:44:40,120
As if I'm being shot, you know?

3778
03:44:40,500 --> 03:44:41,180
By a gun.

3779
03:44:43,300 --> 03:44:44,740
It's, um... I don't know.

3780
03:44:47,220 --> 03:44:48,800
Something very gratifying about it.

3781
03:44:48,880 --> 03:44:49,940
Makes me feel good inside.

3782
03:45:00,050 --> 03:45:05,270
Actually, having the coal in this format here is more space efficient.

3783
03:45:07,110 --> 03:45:10,030
So, not actually the worst thing.

3784
03:45:10,490 --> 03:45:13,230
