3790
03:45:25,410 --> 03:45:25,790
This is horrible.

3791
03:45:29,270 --> 03:45:30,730
Vertical straight line Johnson, man.

3792
03:45:30,850 --> 03:45:31,290
That's the way.

3793
03:45:34,070 --> 03:45:34,450
VSLJ.

3794
03:45:40,560 --> 03:45:46,280
Okay, it looks like we're approaching a different sort of... Oh yeah, look at this.

3795
03:45:46,560 --> 03:45:50,460
We've got, uh... Was it deep... Slate?

3796
03:45:50,680 --> 03:45:51,380
