That is the weirdest thing I've ever seen.

3807
03:46:17,010 --> 03:46:18,870
Why does that stack in five?

3808
03:46:21,610 --> 03:46:22,290
Huh?

3809
03:46:25,050 --> 03:46:25,830
Wait, what?

3810
03:46:26,110 --> 03:46:26,210
Wait.

3811
03:46:26,670 --> 03:46:27,150
Gold?

3812
03:46:31,270 --> 03:46:32,510
Let me use this.

3813
03:46:39,030 --> 03:46:41,970
Did I not just unlock something with gold up here?

3814
03:46:42,010 --> 03:46:42,490
Am I crazy?

3815
03:46:46,400 --> 03:46:46,980
Huh?

3816
03:46:47,580 --> 03:46:48,540
Wait, what?

3817
03:46:49,360 --> 03:46:49,940
Oh.

3818
03:46:52,140 --> 03:46:53,060
Oh, I'm an idiot.

3819
03:46:54,000 --> 03:46:55,540
Oh, but they're different.

3820
03:46:56,260 --> 03:46:57,080
They're different.

3821
03:46:57,420 --> 03:46:58,600
Yeah, they're different.

3822
03:46:59,040 --> 03:47:00,100
It's not the same.

3823
03:47:01,680 --> 03:47:02,260
Goddammit!

3824
03:47:03,020 --> 03:47:04,820
I hate touching silk!

3825
03:47:07,100 --> 03:47:07,680
Ah!

3826
03:47:09,500 --> 03:47:12,100
Leads to all kinds of weird issues like this, you know?

3827
03:47:13,320 --> 03:47:14,680
But I guess I can...

3828
03:47:14,720 --> 03:47:15,560
Plop them in here.

3829
03:47:15,820 --> 03:47:16,440
That's fine.

3830
03:47:18,240 --> 03:47:19,060
Not a big deal.

3831
03:47:22,420 --> 03:47:25,480
Fuck, I should have just gone to a cave that I already knew was established.

3832
03:47:26,600 --> 03:47:27,980
I regret my actions.

3833
03:47:28,360 --> 03:47:29,100
I'm going straight down.

3834
03:47:29,540 --> 03:47:31,720
Well, straight, but still in a staircase street.

3835
03:47:32,280 --> 03:47:34,800
This is the almost straight line Johnson, the ASLJ.

3836
03:47:35,060 --> 03:47:36,660
Very rare straight line Johnson.

3837
03:47:37,380 --> 03:47:42,260
Seen only once every few decades, I would say, on average.

3838
03:47:45,900 --> 03:47:48,120
But when it does happen, you have to appreciate it, you know?

3839
03:47:55,960 --> 03:47:57,320
I'm just happy to have some music.

3840
03:48:02,340 --> 03:48:03,360
There's nothing down here!

3841
03:48:09,680 --> 03:48:10,780
We have to keep the faith.

3842
03:48:10,900 --> 03:48:13,060
Usually when I dig like this, I always find something incredible.

3843
03:48:18,460 --> 03:48:18,900
Huh.

3844
03:48:18,900 --> 03:48:22,440
I wouldn't say this is incredible, but, you know, whatever.

3845
03:48:24,180 --> 03:48:25,220
Not that incredible.

3846
03:48:31,740 --> 03:48:32,400
It's alright.

3847
03:48:36,020 --> 03:48:37,720
Oh god, this is gonna be annoying me.

3848
03:48:45,440 --> 03:48:48,580
I'm surprised I can put a torch on gravel.

3849
03:48:50,180 --> 03:48:51,080
Isn't that weird?

3850
03:48:53,560 --> 03:48:54,900
That's really weird to me.

3851
03:48:55,780 --> 03:48:57,180
That should not be possible.

3852
03:49:03,320 --> 03:49:05,320
Okay, now we're gonna go straight.

3853
03:49:05,720 --> 03:49:06,920
I have a feeling, okay?

3854
03:49:09,760 --> 03:49:14,100
Oh wait, I'm not even getting experience when I... when I silk it.

3855
03:49:15,500 --> 03:49:17,660
Wow, another reason to hate silk touch.

3856
03:49:18,520 --> 03:49:19,540
My goodness.

3857
03:49:20,040 --> 03:49:21,320
Look, I'm... Oh.

3858
03:49:24,580 --> 03:49:28,420
Oh, why was there a furnace symbol on that?

3859
03:49:30,520 --> 03:49:32,580
When I cook this, it becomes it?

3860
03:49:33,240 --> 03:49:34,620
Is that what's happening?

3861
03:49:40,000 --> 03:49:41,520
Oh my god.

3862
03:49:41,940 --> 03:49:42,580
Wait, wait.

3863
03:49:42,960 --> 03:49:44,640
So wait, I need coal to make coal?

3864
03:49:46,740 --> 03:49:47,880
There's no way.

3865
03:49:50,920 --> 03:49:52,940
I need coal to make coal?

3866
03:49:54,660 --> 03:49:55,400
What?

3867
03:49:55,900 --> 03:49:57,620
That makes no fucking sense.

3868
03:50:00,180 --> 03:50:00,920
Whatever.

3869
03:50:01,860 --> 03:50:08,220
I will never go home without a non-silk pickaxe.

3870
03:50:08,440 --> 03:50:09,180
Ever again.

3871
03:50:09,980 --> 03:50:11,840
The last time, Cletus.

3872
03:50:12,700 --> 03:50:13,780
Put that in there.

3873
03:50:14,680 --> 03:50:15,520
We keep going.

3874
03:50:20,480 --> 03:50:22,620
Get ready for amazement.

3875
03:50:25,180 --> 03:50:26,020
Listen.

3876
03:50:31,430 --> 03:50:32,230
Nothing.

3877
03:50:32,490 --> 03:50:33,230
We keep going.

3878
03:50:34,610 --> 03:50:38,450
Such is the way of the professional caver.

3879
03:50:40,050 --> 03:50:42,970
The professional caver stops and then he listens.

3880
03:50:43,610 --> 03:50:46,770
The professional caver knows when to make a turn.

3881
03:50:47,430 --> 03:50:52,510
The professional caver can smell if a certain direction is wrong or right.

3882
03:50:53,950 --> 03:50:58,870
And a professional caver is efficient above all else.

3883
03:51:01,680 --> 03:51:14,800
I would also like to say that I am breaking a rule of the professional caver's handbook, which is never bring a primary pickaxe that is imbued with silk.

3884
03:51:15,920 --> 03:51:16,980
I broke that rule.

3885
03:51:17,180 --> 03:51:17,800
I did.

3886
03:51:18,720 --> 03:51:19,780
I will pay for it.

3887
03:51:20,360 --> 03:51:21,140
What's this stuff?

3888
03:51:21,240 --> 03:51:22,180
Why are we having this now?

3889
03:51:23,720 --> 03:51:24,440
I like it.

3890
03:51:24,620 --> 03:51:25,180
I want more.

3891
03:51:27,100 --> 03:51:28,320
Can I have some more, sir?

3892
03:51:28,640 --> 03:51:28,940
Listen.

3893
03:51:33,580 --> 03:51:34,580
Left and down.

3894
03:51:35,700 --> 03:51:36,480
Trust me.

3895
03:51:38,800 --> 03:51:39,980
Like you once did.

3896
03:51:41,660 --> 03:51:42,940
I love that sentence.

3897
03:51:43,920 --> 03:51:47,040
Imagine saying that to someone, but, like, really meaning it, too.

3898
03:51:49,200 --> 03:51:49,760
Ha!

3899
03:51:53,320 --> 03:51:54,440
We've got something.

3900
03:52:10,320 --> 03:52:11,840
Show thyself.

3901
03:52:20,920 --> 03:52:21,840
Damn.

3902
03:52:22,260 --> 03:52:23,100
I missed it.

3903
03:52:27,820 --> 03:52:29,060
It's up here.

3904
03:52:36,920 --> 03:52:38,020
There we are.

3905
03:52:39,180 --> 03:52:40,940
We have found something.

3906
03:52:46,160 --> 03:52:47,400
God damn it.

3907
03:52:49,240 --> 03:52:50,280
Kill me.

3908
03:52:57,900 --> 03:52:59,140
That is horrible.

3909
03:53:06,740 --> 03:53:08,040
That was a weird sound.

3910
03:53:09,300 --> 03:53:11,200
The hell was that all about?

3911
03:53:18,260 --> 03:53:20,920
I don't think I want any of this iron.

3912
03:53:21,520 --> 03:53:22,720
Iron I have enough of.

3913
03:53:27,280 --> 03:53:28,600
Now I'm going up again.

3914
03:53:28,760 --> 03:53:29,380
Isn't that weird?

3915
03:53:32,820 --> 03:53:34,720
I mean, there is a cave system here.

3916
03:53:34,960 --> 03:53:36,320
Not much is confirmed.

3917
03:53:38,080 --> 03:53:39,600
But, uh...

3918
03:53:42,720 --> 03:53:44,160
Does it lead to anything?

3919
03:53:44,320 --> 03:53:45,140
That's the question.

3920
03:53:47,540 --> 03:53:48,860
Something exciting, maybe.

3921
03:53:49,480 --> 03:53:50,860
This looks sort of exciting.

3922
03:53:54,280 --> 03:53:54,960
Got him.

3923
03:53:56,840 --> 03:53:59,100
Every creeper I see shall be slain.

3924
03:54:01,140 --> 03:54:01,960
Oh, god.

3925
03:54:02,180 --> 03:54:03,980
I have... Oh, shit.

3926
03:54:03,980 --> 03:54:05,240
I have no more torches!

3927
03:54:05,900 --> 03:54:08,080
This is... Man, I've forgotten how to cave.

3928
03:54:08,800 --> 03:54:10,180
I have lost my touch.

3929
03:54:11,170 --> 03:54:14,010
And instead, it's been replaced by Silk Touch.

3930
03:54:15,850 --> 03:54:21,010
Actually, the worst... We gotta get the fuck out of here.

3931
03:54:21,090 --> 03:54:24,230
This is the worst disaster of all time.

3932
03:54:25,150 --> 03:54:26,010
What am I doing?

3933
