I'm leaving with knowledge, at least.

3935
03:54:31,130 --> 03:54:33,990
We need to find a big room, and we're gonna see where the enemies spawn.

3936
03:54:35,030 --> 03:54:37,250
That's why I came here.

3937
03:54:37,430 --> 03:54:38,230
I wanna know.

3938
03:54:39,600 --> 03:54:40,460
And that's it.

3939
03:54:41,680 --> 03:54:42,680
Any big rooms?

3940
03:54:45,900 --> 03:54:47,200
I don't care if it's dark.

3941
03:54:51,320 --> 03:54:52,200
Something up here.

3942
03:54:54,220 --> 03:54:56,420
We're podcasting for a short while here.

3943
03:54:57,540 --> 03:54:58,760
Okay, this looks promising.

3944
03:54:59,240 --> 03:55:00,180
That's a big room.

3945
03:55:04,300 --> 03:55:04,820
Okay.

3946
03:55:11,630 --> 03:55:12,610
Keep an eye out.

3947
03:55:14,990 --> 03:55:15,810
We're observing.

3948
03:55:24,650 --> 03:55:26,050
There's light over there.

3949
03:55:26,270 --> 03:55:27,830
So they're not going to spawn over there.

3950
03:55:31,050 --> 03:55:32,210
Oh, is that outside?

3951
03:55:32,530 --> 03:55:33,050
Oh, shit.

3952
03:55:33,050 --> 03:55:33,970
We're kind of high up.

3953
03:55:36,050 --> 03:55:38,610
I thought I was still sort of close to the bottom.

3954
03:55:44,940 --> 03:55:46,040
Okay, so I'm gonna kill you.

3955
03:55:49,920 --> 03:55:51,560
Let's walk all the way over here.

3956
