3957
03:56:04,040 --> 03:56:07,900
Wait a minute, why is there... Oh, it's this sort of glow thingy.

3958
03:56:09,220 --> 03:56:10,240
Glow moss or whatever?

3959
03:56:24,740 --> 03:56:26,520
Oh, that is quite the drop, isn't it?

3960
03:56:29,160 --> 03:56:35,820
I could fall down there and land on the water like a pro, but that's a bit too risky, especially with no coal.

3961
03:56:36,560 --> 03:56:41,240
And even if I find coal, I can't use it, because I have silk touch.

3962
03:56:42,480 --> 03:56:43,060
I'm leaving.

3963
03:56:43,240 --> 03:56:43,780
I hate this.

3964
03:56:43,880 --> 03:56:45,320
This is the worst expedition of my life.

3965
03:56:45,500 --> 03:56:48,680
This is, like, absolutely going to be stricken from the record.

3966
03:56:50,000 --> 03:56:50,920
This never happened.

3967
03:56:52,140 --> 03:56:52,720
We're leaving.

3968
03:56:53,730 --> 03:56:55,350
Terrible, terrible expedition.

3969
03:57:00,120 --> 03:57:05,640
All the rules and regulations that I learned in the past have not been applied this time around.

3970
03:57:05,840 --> 03:57:06,600
I have failed.

3971
03:57:08,240 --> 03:57:16,660
The professional caver card needs to be handed in at my local league or whatever.

3972
03:57:17,060 --> 03:57:17,820
You know what I mean.

3973
03:57:20,000 --> 03:57:21,020
Where am I actually?

3974
03:57:21,240 --> 03:57:22,240
How far did I go downstairs?

3975
03:57:24,200 --> 03:57:25,920
Can I save my home from here?

3976
03:57:27,240 --> 03:57:28,140
That's the question.

3977
03:57:30,510 --> 03:57:31,590
What the fuck?

3978
03:57:33,810 --> 03:57:35,510
I started up there, I think.

3979
03:57:37,970 --> 03:57:39,530
And I went all the way over here.

3980
03:57:44,900 --> 03:57:47,460
See, this is the sort of cave I should have been looking for from the beginning.

3981
03:57:48,500 --> 03:57:51,740
Just an opening in the ground where there's obviously a big cave, you know?

3982
03:57:54,060 --> 03:57:57,980
I'm gonna do that next time when I bring my actual pickaxe and I go on another adventure.

3983
03:58:00,120 --> 03:58:02,060
None of this go on top of a mountain thing anymore.

3984
03:58:03,440 --> 03:58:04,860
But I mean, I guess the idea was there.

3985
03:58:05,860 --> 03:58:06,320
Where's my boat?

3986
03:58:09,400 --> 03:58:11,640
I guess I gotta go home and cook a lot now, right?

3987
03:58:12,280 --> 03:58:16,140
I gotta cook all this crap to extract the nutrients.

3988
03:58:18,120 --> 03:58:18,960
The good stuff.

3989
03:58:24,940 --> 03:58:28,180
I think you could comfortably say that I could see my house from where I emerged.

3990
03:58:35,380 --> 03:58:36,300
Oh, wait a minute.

3991
03:58:38,180 --> 03:58:40,380
That is the mountain I went on, isn't it?

3992
03:58:41,920 --> 03:58:42,940
I remember this.

3993
03:58:45,200 --> 03:58:46,360
I w... wait.

3994
03:58:50,500 --> 03:58:52,300
Yeah, very disorienting stuff.

3995
03:58:53,200 --> 03:58:54,000
Oh, you know what?

3996
03:58:54,040 --> 03:58:55,740
We can check the hole we made now.

3997
03:58:56,420 --> 03:59:03,200
I mean, if there's no enemies now, then it's like mega confirmed that we need a bigger hole, right?

3998
03:59:04,740 --> 03:59:11,560
One thing we know for sure is that my basement is big enough because there's constantly mobs spawning down there.

3999
03:59:14,220 --> 03:59:16,420
So the question is how much smaller can we make it, right?

4000
03:59:21,400 --> 03:59:23,500
I guess I could put water in my basement.

4001
03:59:24,220 --> 03:59:26,600
But is that going to mess up the redstone stuff?

4002
03:59:26,720 --> 03:59:27,040
I wonder.

4003
03:59:28,600 --> 03:59:29,220
Uh-oh.

4004
03:59:29,480 --> 03:59:30,040
Uh-oh.

4005
03:59:41,190 --> 03:59:41,970
Let's check it.

4006
03:59:42,990 --> 03:59:43,590
Okay, guys, prediction.

4007
03:59:43,810 --> 03:59:44,850
Do we have mobs down there?

4008
03:59:44,890 --> 03:59:45,390
Yes or no?

4009
03:59:46,570 --> 03:59:48,390
I say yes.

4010
03:59:49,470 --> 03:59:50,590
I say yes.

4011
03:59:53,810 --> 03:59:54,690
Definitely yes.

4012
03:59:57,880 --> 03:59:58,760
Oh, no.

4013
03:59:59,300 --> 04:00:00,860
I never closed it off!

4014
04:00:03,920 --> 04:00:06,020
Uh... Maybe that wouldn't have mattered.

4015
04:00:06,220 --> 04:00:06,520
I don't know.

4016
04:00:07,240 --> 04:00:08,700
Why is nothing down here, though?

4017
04:00:11,080 --> 04:00:12,760
God damn it, man.

4018
04:00:14,340 --> 04:00:15,360
Close it off.

4019
04:00:16,000 --> 04:00:17,000
Come back later.

4020
04:00:18,300 --> 04:00:18,880
Shit.

4021
04:00:22,560 --> 04:00:23,140
Okay.

4022
04:00:24,040 --> 04:00:24,960
Any babies?

4023
04:00:31,670 --> 04:00:32,610
I don't think so.

4024
04:00:34,650 --> 04:00:35,870
You're the smite guy?

4025
04:00:36,690 --> 04:00:37,610
Wait, what is this?

4026
04:00:41,750 --> 04:00:42,990
What the fuck is that?

4027
04:00:44,290 --> 04:00:44,730
Oh!

4028
04:00:46,390 --> 04:00:47,210
I made that.

4029
04:00:48,690 --> 04:00:52,750
I was like, is that some kind of transformed version of the Beehive?

4030
04:00:52,890 --> 04:00:53,830
Is it spreading?

4031
04:00:53,950 --> 04:00:54,630
What's happening here?

4032
04:00:55,270 --> 04:00:56,830
I completely forgot I placed that.

4033
04:00:56,950 --> 04:00:57,410
Holy crap.

4034
04:00:58,630 --> 04:00:59,550
It's cooking time.

4035
04:01:00,730 --> 04:01:03,950
And I do believe we can use ourselves a blaster for that.

4036
04:01:05,790 --> 04:01:06,230
Right?

4037
04:01:07,630 --> 04:01:09,090
So anyway, I started blasting.

4038
04:01:13,480 --> 04:01:13,900
Yeah!

4039
04:01:13,900 --> 04:01:14,800
But we need coal.

4040
04:01:17,240 --> 04:01:18,060
I have a bit.

4041
04:01:19,800 --> 04:01:21,880
Wait, we should totally use the coal to get the coal.

4042
04:01:24,840 --> 04:01:25,940
This is so dumb.

4043
04:01:26,680 --> 04:01:27,720
How much, at least?

4044
04:01:32,830 --> 04:01:35,450
This is so... I don't even know what to say.

4045
04:01:37,430 --> 04:01:39,590
I guess this is gonna give me experience.

4046
04:01:39,950 --> 04:01:40,470
Please.

4047
04:01:41,790 --> 04:01:42,890
It's not.

4048
04:01:44,350 --> 04:01:44,950
Bro.

4049
04:01:45,930 --> 04:01:48,790
Silk Touch is... the worst.

4050
04:01:51,610 --> 04:01:52,590
The worst.

4051
04:01:53,850 --> 04:01:56,110
You go back inside this fucking box.

4052
04:01:56,890 --> 04:02:00,470
We're gonna utilize a proper pickaxe in the future.

